Subject: [PATCH 5/7] feat(compute-providers): add Lizard sandbox client

Implements ComputeProviderClient over @lizard-build/sdk 1.0.22. Command
execution uses the SDK's native argv + exit code path, so no exit sentinel
is needed for attached commands; detached commands append to a log file read
back through the SDK filesystem API.
